docs {
  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. With no folder.bru, Bruno orders folders ALPHABETICALLY, so
  `accounts` ran before `auth` and every request in it went out unauthenticated.
  Measured 2026-09-21 before this file existed: 1 of 24 requests passed.

  This folder is 5 because it replays deposits, so it runs after a balance exists.
}
